---
title: From a submitted requirement to the workers it affects
---
flowchart TB
  subgraph INPUT["One user conversation"]
    D["Draft speech or text and optional local preview"] -->|Send or explicit finish-and-send| I["Durable message ID, chat sequence, reply-to and focus at input start"]
    I --> B["Bind explicit question answers or split into ordered intents<br/>Later corrections amend pending work"]
    B --> ROUTER["Router reads compact indexed graph cards and quoted context<br/>No tools that can edit assignments or files"]
    ROUTER --> CHECK{"Kernel validates target and evidence"}
    STOP["Stop button or explicit stop command"] --> HALT["Kernel fences new turns and records current effects"]
  end
  CHECK -->|General question| STATUS["Read task, test or push receipts<br/>Answer in the same chat"]
  CHECK -->|Execution control| CTL["Kernel changes named pause, priority or preference<br/>Verify receipts for a completed human action"]
  CHECK -->|New feature| NEW["Deduplicate against project feature records<br/>Current release unless explicitly deferred"]
  CHECK -->|Target unclear| Q["One named focused question card, queued by criterion"]
  CHECK -->|Existing change| OWNER["Task author or leased successor<br/>Shared scope goes to project planner"]
  NEW -->|Assigned current scope| OWNER
  OWNER --> HOLD["Infer-or-ask traces affected contracts for each reading<br/>All: hard hold. Some: soft hold. None: continue."]
  HOLD --> S["Select general questions by uncovered scope<br/>2–3 for small changes, up to 5 otherwise; fill gaps locally"]
  S --> E{"Current-scope decisions and material dependencies ready?"}
  E -->|Can resolve next decisions from grounded facts| S
  E -->|Missing detail, conflict or deferred choice now needed| Q
  Q -->|Explicitly submitted evidence| I
  E -->|Yes, including zero user questions| P["Show behavioral delta and acceptance example<br/>Planner drafts affected rule, contract, task, UI and test revisions"]
  P --> TX["Kernel validates node and edge versions, then commits graph,<br/>briefs, versioned records and notification outbox atomically"]
  TX --> DIS["Deliver to current role and assignment epoch<br/>Changed contract: fresh brief and WIP diff when old context conflicts"]
  DIS --> V["Kernel verifies against locked acceptance cases and contract versions<br/>Task author integrates into production path"]
